sequenceDiagram
  actor S as Penjual
  actor B as Pembeli
  participant FE as React
  participant API as Express
  participant DB as MySQL

  S->>FE: unggah bukti kerja
  FE->>API: POST submission
  API->>DB: work_submissions
  B->>FE: tinjau hasil
  alt revisi maks 3
    FE->>API: minta revisi
    API-->>S: notifikasi
  else setujui
    FE->>API: setujui
    API->>DB: COMPLETED + cair wallet
  else sengketa
    FE->>API: buka sengketa
    API->>DB: DISPUTED
  end
